(7571360, 1215533, 59737, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and colors, nice blue in the sky and a strong DoF.<br/> <br/>Quite a while back now I was told by another photographer to only shoot the punchline, this image immediately made me think of that saying; for me the bicyclist is the focal point but there''s so much else in the photo he seems kind of lost.  You may have been shooting to get the whole playground for the challenge but personally this would have been stronger for me with a tighter picture of the rider.<br/> <br/>Have a great day</td>', 'Good exposure and colors, nice blue in the sky and a strong DoF. Quite a while back now I was told by another photographer to only shoot the punchline, this image immediately made me think of that saying; for me the bicyclist is the focal point but there''s so much else in the photo he seems kind of lost.  You may have been shooting to get the whole playground for the challenge but personally this would have been stronger for me with a tighter picture of the rider. Have a great day', '2018-06-12 20:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
