(7572952, 1215384, 67145, '<td valign="top">so when i first saw this .. like i said in my first comment .. i found it magical .. <br/>and i havent been able to get it out of my mind .. not 100% of the time mind you .. ;) .. but occasionally it pops in .. <br/>i''m wondering if you could tell me how you got this photo .. with the smokey look and the boy so sharp jumping out of it .. from memory you cant add stuff like the smokey look to a photo in post processing ... <br/>i''m so intrigued by this ...<br/>and often ppl say that if you know how something is done it can lose its appeal ... not to me .. it would probably add to the appeal .. <br/>anyway .. you may not remember .. as i have been gone for a long time from dpc .. but my middle name is anita .. :)<br/>also .. i can see how active you have been here and all the ribbons and hm''s adorning your page .. <br/>you are truly a great photographer ... :)<br/> <br/>oh .. edited to add . <br/>i looked to see how many challenges you have entered .. <br/>and one more and it will be 1111 .. i''m not sure if you are aware of the significance of the numbers 1111 in regards to numerology, spirituality, synchronicity and manifesting  .. but it gave me a good feeling seeing it there .. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-06-22 07:01:44.</i></td>', 'so when i first saw this .. like i said in my first comment .. i found it magical .. and i havent been able to get it out of my mind .. not 100% of the time mind you .. ;) .. but occasionally it pops in .. i''m wondering if you could tell me how you got this photo .. with the smokey look and the boy so sharp jumping out of it .. from memory you cant add stuff like the smokey look to a photo in post processing ... i''m so intrigued by this ...and often ppl say that if you know how something is done it can lose its appeal ... not to me .. it would probably add to the appeal .. anyway .. you may not remember .. as i have been gone for a long time from dpc .. but my middle name is anita .. :)also .. i can see how active you have been here and all the ribbons and hm''s adorning your page .. you are truly a great photographer ... :) oh .. edited to add . i looked to see how many challenges you have entered .. and one more and it will be 1111 .. i''m not sure if you are aware of the significance of the numbers 1111 in regards to numerology, spirituality, synchronicity and manifesting  .. but it gave me a good feeling seeing it there .. :)', '2018-06-22 07:57:33.000000', '2018-06-22 08:01:44.000000', 0),
(7573102, 1215384, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> so when i first saw this .. like i said in my first comment .. i found it magical .. <br/>and i havent been able to get it out of my mind .. not 100% of the time mind you .. ;) .. but occasionally it pops in .. <br/>i''m wondering if you could tell me how you got this photo .. with the smokey look and the boy so sharp jumping out of it .. from memory you cant add stuff like the smokey look to a photo in post processing ... <br/>i''m so intrigued by this ...<br/>and often ppl say that if you know how something is done it can lose its appeal ... not to me .. it would probably add to the appeal .. <br/>anyway .. you may not remember .. as i have been gone for a long time from dpc .. but my middle name is anita .. :)<br/>also .. i can see how active you have been here and all the ribbons and hm''s adorning your page .. <br/>you are truly a great photographer ... :)<br/> <br/>oh .. edited to add . <br/>i looked to see how many challenges you have entered .. <br/>and one more and it will be 1111 .. i''m not sure if you are aware of the significance of the numbers 1111 in regards to numerology, spirituality, synchronicity and manifesting  .. but it gave me a good feeling seeing it there .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Roz, and no I didnt know your middle name was Anita, thats my middle name too, my first name I dont go by. <br/> <br/>Anyway to answer your question, I didnt add the smoke (haze) or whatever you want to call it. This was taken at a water park and in between the water sprays they have mist coming out of the jets, it occurs maybe only 3 time per hour, its the best part of the the whole park. The mist gives the appearance of a foggy haze and you can see the kids go bananas for it. In PP I did smooth out the haze to give it a dreamy look. Hope that helps, and BTW so happy to see you back, look forward to seeing your work.<br/> <br/>To answer your question about the significance of numbers I am aware of a few numbers and their importance but as for 1111 Im not too sure.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2018-06-23 07:50:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by roz: so when i first saw this .. like i said in my first comment .. i found it magical .. and i havent been able to get it out of my mind .. not 100% of the time mind you .. ;) .. but occasionally it pops in .. i''m wondering if you could tell me how you got this photo .. with the smokey look and the boy so sharp jumping out of it .. from memory you cant add stuff like the smokey look to a photo in post processing ... i''m so intrigued by this ...and often ppl say that if you know how something is done it can lose its appeal ... not to me .. it would probably add to the appeal .. anyway .. you may not remember .. as i have been gone for a long time from dpc .. but my middle name is anita .. :)also .. i can see how active you have been here and all the ribbons and hm''s adorning your page .. you are truly a great photographer ... :) oh .. edited to add . i looked to see how many challenges you have entered .. and one more and it will be 1111 .. i''m not sure if you are aware of the significance of the numbers 1111 in regards to numerology, spirituality, synchronicity and manifesting  .. but it gave me a good feeling seeing it there .. :)   Thanks Roz, and no I didnt know your middle name was Anita, thats my middle name too, my first name I dont go by.  Anyway to answer your question, I didnt add the smoke (haze) or whatever you want to call it. This was taken at a water park and in between the water sprays they have mist coming out of the jets, it occurs maybe only 3 time per hour, its the best part of the the whole park. The mist gives the appearance of a foggy haze and you can see the kids go bananas for it. In PP I did smooth out the haze to give it a dreamy look. Hope that helps, and BTW so happy to see you back, look forward to seeing your work. To answer your question about the significance of numbers I am aware of a few numbers and their importance but as for 1111 Im not too sure.', '2018-06-23 08:49:40.000000', '2018-06-23 08:50:42.000000', 0),
